月亮到底有多亮？比阿嬷最喜欢的那颗蚌珠还亮吗？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x13D9B2CD8A38FB4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1910237031:1":{"text":"为什么我们看不到太阳和月亮呀？是不是只有离开海，才能看到、摸到它们？","source_cn":"为什么我们看不到太阳和月亮呀？是不是只有离开海，才能看...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xF2F6FFBC79FB81EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1910237032:0":{"text":"离开海？那也太可怕了……","source_cn":"离开海？那也太可怕了……","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x62772AC496408CCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1910237033:1":{"text":"离开海也摸不到，太阳和月亮都在天上很高很高的地方挂着。","source_cn":"离开海也摸不到，太阳和月亮都在天上很高很高的地方挂着。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x4FC73525FCAF7CB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1910237034:0":{"text":"挂着？是谁把它们挂在那么远的地方？如果是哥哥的水行器，是不是就能跑到了？","source_cn":"挂着？是谁把它们挂在那么远的地方？如果是哥哥的水行器，...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xA97EC961A9B63A6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1910237035:0":{"text":"……也不行。地面离天空比离深海的海底还远。","source_cn":"……也不行。地面离天空比离深海的海底还远。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xDAD6412F1A2A4EA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1910237036:0":{"text":"真的吗，你怎么知道的？我都不知道海底有多深！","source_cn":"真的吗，你怎么知道的？我都不知道海底有多深！","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x04796545B3BAFD43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1910237037:0":{"text":"呵呵……因为海是有底的，天空却是没有顶的。","source_cn":"呵呵……因为海是有底的，天空却是没有顶的。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xEF5F1AC6DBCEA9E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1910237038:0":{"text":"姐姐，你去过深海的海底吗？","source_cn":"姐姐，你去过深海的海底吗？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x8EE594A96FA47E2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1910237039:1":{"text":"没有呢，虽然我的确很想去那里冒险，但——","source_cn":"没有呢，虽然我的确很想去那里冒险，但——","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xF2B97B78EB4ED81A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1910237040:1":{"text":"——但是深海对我们来说非常危险，我们是无法在那里生存的。塔拉萨才是我们应该在的地方，这里最安全、最美好。","source_cn":"——但是深海对我们来说非常危险，我们是无法在那里生存的...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xC7B061366590357E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1910237041:1":{"text":"好了，故事听完了，大家来吃餐后甜藻吧。","source_cn":"好了，故事听完了，大家来吃餐后甜藻吧。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x13FF9C2939939F79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1910237042:1":{"text":"呵呵……小汐儿不是也爱吃这个吗？怎么发着呆，想什么呢？","source_cn":"呵呵……小汐儿不是也爱吃这个吗？怎么发着呆，想什么呢？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x42C55437C75C9E9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1910237043:0":{"text":"想，爬高……去天上。","source_cn":"想，爬高……去天上。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xB935B69E2970B8B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1910237044:1":{"text":"年幼的海裔呆呆地盯着图澜的头顶，然后……竟然灵活地爬了上去！","source_cn":"年幼的海裔呆呆地盯着图澜的头顶，然后……竟然灵活地爬了上去！","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x27386F0CED245077","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1910237045:1":{"text":"像……骑水行器。","source_cn":"像……骑水行器。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x8FA69EE9D916D472","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1910237046:1":{"text":"哈？小崽子，你把咱当成水行器骑？","source_cn":"哈？小崽子，你把咱当成水行器骑？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xA670E8A21BC5AFEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1910237047:1":{"text":"嘴上这么说着，但图澜却真的装作水行器，背上年幼的小海裔，绕着餐桌跑了起来。屋内众人欢笑不止。","source_cn":"嘴上这么说着，但图澜却真的装作水行器，背上年幼的小海裔...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x79AC1E601D0660E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1910237048:1":{"text":"塔拉萨，神秘的海中之城……在这里，你需要探索的事情还有很多。但至少此刻，你只需尽情享受这份简单的快乐。","source_cn":"塔拉萨，神秘的海中之城……在这里，你需要探索的事情还有...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x42905ED922565DA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:59:1910237049:0":{"text":"你们沉浸在欢乐之中，直到一声巨响，打破了此刻难得的安宁","source_cn":"你们沉浸在欢乐之中，直到一声巨响，打破了此刻难得的安宁","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xEB585E69AC4A6575","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:0:1":{"text":"我要来十份！","source_cn":"我要来十份！","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x54E86D16441AC8B3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"95835","variant_female_record_index":"95836","document_title":"","document_title_ma